===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To attend, wait upon, [[serve]] [[obsequiously]].
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Antony|I|3|text=[T]he ebbed man, ne'er loved till ne'er worth love,<br>Comes deared by being lacked. This common body,<br>Like to a vagabond flag upon the stream,<br>Goes to and back, '''lackeying''' the varying tide,<br>To rot itself with motion.}}
#* {{RQ:Milton Comus|text=So dear to Heav'n is Saintly chastity,<br>That when a soul is found sincerely so,<br>A thousand liveried Angels '''lacky''' her {{...}}}}
